{"message":"The financial object is PPG's reserve for product warranties. The source states the reserve was $10 million as of Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million as of Dec. 31, 2005. I calculate the 2005-to-2006 change as 2006 reserve minus 2005 reserve, in USD millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"a - b","variables":{"a":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"b":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"a":"source:q11n3","b":"source:q11n4"}}}